# Source: Day 9 Plan Phase 2 -- keep the build context small. The repo is
# bind-mounted into every service at runtime (dev-parity), so almost nothing
# needs to enter an image. Only pyproject.toml / uv.lock (scorer image) and the
# two frontend package manifests (frontend images) are COPYed in.

.git/
.venv/
**/node_modules/
**/__pycache__/
**/*.pyc
.pytest_cache/
.verify60x/
.superpowers/
.worktrees/

# Large host-side state (bind-mounted at runtime, never imaged)
data/
spool/
models/
tollgate.db
tollgate.db-shm
tollgate.db-wal
*.log

# Frontend build/test output
services/*/dist/
services/dashboard/playwright-report/
services/dashboard/blob-report/
services/dashboard/test-results/
services/dashboard/coverage/

# Day 9 evidence + docs (not needed in any image)
evidence/
*.md
